  "instructions": [
    "Combine cumin, cayenne pepper and salt in a small bowl.",
    "In a hot pot vessel, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat. Add chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped carrots, lemongrass and fish stock. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Add green melon and cook for 5 minutes or until tender.",
    "Stir in coconut milk and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning with black pepper.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with chopped cilantro and a dollop of coconut milk.",
    "Cook sous-vide in preheated water bath at 180°F for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "If desired, serve with crusty bread or over rice for added starch."
